  m_text: You are a radiologist. One fine day, while working in the labratory you
    took a short nap and found yourself been turned into a scribbled version. Your
    goal is to navigate through the maze, solve the quesions, gather as many points
    as you can and turn your self back to normal. Utilizing your knowledge of radiology,
    your aim is to collect the 6 keys, unlock the maze and get out safely.
